# Workspace Wiki Index

Summary: Navigation root for `.za/wiki/`, the workspace's private source of truth for observable behavior, architecture and domain knowledge.

## How this wiki works

- One topic per page, flat layout at `.za/wiki/`; project pages are named `<project-id>-<topic>.md`, workspace pages are named freely. Optional images live under `img/`.
- Page shape: [`.za/templates/wiki.md`](../templates/wiki.md). Where a project's `sot.md` names a page here as the authority for a scope, that page governs (COMMON `policy.md` P-20); superseded sources stay recorded in that `sot.md`'s Evidence column.
- Requirements on normative pages carry stable IDs (`R-01`, `R-02`, ...) so issues and decisions can reference them precisely.

